[[Open This|Configure network interfaces on Helios]]

---

```
dladm show-phys
dladm show-ether
ipadm show-addr

ipadm create-if ixgbe0
ipadm create-addr -T dhcp -h $(hostname) ixgbe0/dhcp
svcadm restart network/service
ipadm show-addr

ping 8.8.8.8
ping google.com
```

In my case it was bge0

```
ipadm create-if bge0
ipadm create-addr -T dhcp -h $(hostname) bge0/dhcp
svcadm restart network/service
ipadm show-addr
```